            <div class="accordion-body text-white">
              <p class="fs-16 mb-0">We use three main categories: Customer KPIs (Acquisition Cost, Conversion Rate), Project KPIs (Time per project, Planned vs Actual hours), and Financial KPIs (Monthly Recurring Revenue, Gross Profit Margin, Lifetime Value). This holistic approach ensures the campaign is efficient, effective, and profitable.</p>
